{"id":"f99a98741c0bc690","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-levy-hw-projection.md","title":"Lévy收缩投影为HW收缩","display":"lem-levy-hw-projection — Lévy收缩投影为HW收缩","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"lemma","label":"56-lem-levy-hw-projection","aliases":["56-lem-levy-hw-projection"],"display":"lem-levy-hw-projection — Lévy收缩投影为HW收缩","depends_on":["[[56-df-levy-label-depth]]","[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]"],"source_section":"§8.4.6 Exercise 8.4.53; Definition 8.4.51","source_printed_pages":"359","source_ocr_blocks":[380],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-levy-hw-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-levy-hw-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-levy-hw-projection — Lévy收缩投影为HW收缩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" href=\"?note=3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" title=\"56-df-levy-label-depth\">56-df-levy-label-depth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4.6 Exercise 8.4.53; Definition 8.4.51"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"359"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>380</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" href=\"?note=3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" title=\"56-df-levy-label-depth\">56-df-levy-label-depth</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_R\">\\(\\Pi_R\\)</span> 及HW项/规则接口。红项投影与单步相容式的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat s\\in T_R^L\">\\(\\hat s\\in T_R^L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))\">\\(u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Deg}_R(\\hat s,u)=(\\lambda,\\hat l)\">\\(\\operatorname{Deg}_R(\\hat s,u)=(\\lambda,\\hat l)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LStep}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{LStep}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(l,r)\">\\(\\lambda=(l,r)\\)</span>。具体HW红项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ctr}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}\">\\(\\operatorname{ctr}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a> 实例化。最后的初标相容式独立以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span> 为局部参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HRed}_R(\\hat s,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left(q,\\Pi_R(\\hat l),\\operatorname{paint}_{\\mathrm H}\\left(r,1+\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}(\\Pi_R(\\hat l))\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HRed}_R(\\hat s,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left(q,\\Pi_R(\\hat l),\\operatorname{paint}_{\\mathrm H}\\left(r,1+\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}(\\Pi_R(\\hat l))\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HRed}_R(\\hat s,u)\\in\n\\operatorname{Red}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}(\\Pi_R(\\hat s)),\\qquad\n\\Pi_R(\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))=\n\\operatorname{ctr}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}(\\Pi_R(\\hat s),\\operatorname{HRed}_R(\\hat s,u)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HRed}_R(\\hat s,u)\\in\n\\operatorname{Red}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}(\\Pi_R(\\hat s)),\\qquad\n\\Pi_R(\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))=\n\\operatorname{ctr}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}(\\Pi_R(\\hat s),\\operatorname{HRed}_R(\\hat s,u)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_R(\\operatorname{LInit}_R(s))=\\operatorname{HInit}_R(s)\\qquad(s\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_R(\\operatorname{LInit}_R(s))=\\operatorname{HInit}_R(s)\\qquad(s\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对项结构归纳，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_R\">\\(\\Pi_R\\)</span> 与项替换、位置替换交换；匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat s|_q=\\hat l\\hat\\sigma\">\\(\\hat s|_q=\\hat l\\hat\\sigma\\)</span> 因而投为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_R(\\hat s)|_q=\\Pi_R(\\hat l)(\\Pi_R\\hat\\sigma)\">\\(\\Pi_R(\\hat s)|_q=\\Pi_R(\\hat l)(\\Pi_R\\hat\\sigma)\\)</span>。Lévy右模式每个函数位置p的符号是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C(\\lambda,\\hat l,p)\">\\(\\mathsf C(\\lambda,\\hat l,p)\\)</span>，其擦除为r(p)，其深度由定义都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1+\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}(\\Pi_R\\hat l)\">\\(1+\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}(\\Pi_R\\hat l)\\)</span>。所以该右模式的投影恰是公式中的HW染色右项；变量实例投影后保持原位复制或删除。上下文同态性完成收缩等式。原子深度0给最后的初始项等式。</p>\n<p>该论证同时验证原书Exercise 8.4.53中FFD需要的labelling因子化方向；没有把仅有深度数字的映射误当成保留函数符号的项映射。含collapsing规则时右模式是变量，两侧同样经替换交换得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-levy-label-depth","status":"resolved","id":"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-label-depth]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-label-depth","status":"resolved","id":"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-label-depth]] 的 $\\Pi_R$ 及HW项/规则接口。红项投影与单步相容式的局部参数为 $\\hat s\\in T_R^L$、$u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))$；$\\operatorname{Deg}_R(\\hat s,u)=(\\lambda,\\hat l)$ 与 $\\operatorname{LStep}_R$ 见 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]，其中 $\\lambda=(l,r)$。具体HW红项 $\\operatorname{Red}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}$ 与 $\\operatorname{ctr}_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}$ 由 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]] 实例化。最后的初标相容式独立以 $s\\in T$ 为局部参数。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothe